WEBVTT

01:18.650 --> 01:21.880
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.910 --> 01:24.830
[Episode 12]

01:30.150 --> 01:31.560
Hello, fire inspection?

01:31.920 --> 01:32.920
This way, please.

01:34.680 --> 01:35.270
Dang...

01:44.070 --> 01:45.350
The inspection records say

01:45.350 --> 01:47.720
that you failed the last inspection.

01:48.120 --> 01:48.759
Don't be nervous.

01:48.759 --> 01:51.090
You prepared very well this time.

01:51.350 --> 01:52.990
Look, from the fire extinguisher here

01:52.990 --> 01:54.039
to the fire hose

01:54.039 --> 01:55.789
and the maintenance records here,

01:55.789 --> 01:56.830
you've done a great job.

01:56.830 --> 01:57.789
If you did this every time,

01:57.789 --> 01:59.550
it would also save us
a lot of trouble, right?

01:59.550 --> 02:01.040
But there's one thing.
Come over and take a look.

02:01.040 --> 02:01.850
This alarm

02:01.950 --> 02:03.760
must not be blocked,

02:03.760 --> 02:06.450
or it will affect its sensitivity, okay?

02:09.440 --> 02:11.170
There are no major issues here.

02:11.200 --> 02:13.350
We just need to pay close attention

02:13.350 --> 02:15.510
to fire safety equipment expiry
in future inspections.

02:15.510 --> 02:17.110
There's nothing else other than that.

02:17.110 --> 02:17.930
Chief,

02:18.440 --> 02:19.160
my

02:19.480 --> 02:20.740
stomach is a bit upset.

02:20.760 --> 02:21.480
Can I...

02:21.550 --> 02:22.110
Go ahead.

02:22.110 --> 02:22.880
I'll wait for you up ahead.

02:22.880 --> 02:23.510
Okay.

02:45.230 --> 02:46.579
Mrs. Fang.

02:48.550 --> 02:50.880
My mom asked you
to keep an eye on me, didn't she?

02:50.880 --> 02:52.600
The moment I entered the building,

02:52.600 --> 02:54.920
I just noticed
that you were secretly following me.

02:54.920 --> 02:56.600
From the time
we started the fire inspection until now,

02:56.600 --> 02:57.930
It's been about 2 hours.

02:57.950 --> 02:59.600
During this time,

02:59.600 --> 03:01.300
you haven't done any real cleaning work.

03:01.300 --> 03:03.960
You've been secretly tailing me
the whole time.

03:05.230 --> 03:07.000
It's pointless doing it now.

03:07.920 --> 03:09.320
I led you here

03:09.320 --> 03:10.550
just to remind you

03:10.720 --> 03:12.330
that the cameras are all on.

03:12.480 --> 03:13.670
If the property management sees it,

03:13.670 --> 03:14.770
they'll think you were slacking off

03:14.770 --> 03:16.170
and fine you, I'm afraid.

03:16.510 --> 03:18.070
Why would they fine me?

03:29.630 --> 03:30.880
Mom!

03:38.000 --> 03:40.050
You called Mrs. Fang,

03:40.280 --> 03:41.829
and she let you take her shift?

03:41.829 --> 03:44.290
Well, she also knew that... um...

03:44.480 --> 03:46.340
I was doing this for your own good.

03:46.440 --> 03:47.640
For my own good,

03:48.040 --> 03:49.320
or to keep an eye on me?

03:51.720 --> 03:52.630
However,

03:52.880 --> 03:55.660
your disguise just now was
really successful.

03:55.790 --> 03:57.520
I really didn't recognize you.

03:59.760 --> 04:01.640
That's all your fault.

04:01.920 --> 04:04.000
You wouldn't tell me who she is.

04:04.040 --> 04:06.380
So I had no choice but to find out myself.

04:06.480 --> 04:08.010
Did you find anything then?

04:09.960 --> 04:10.870
Well, today,

04:12.480 --> 04:13.760
so far,

04:14.350 --> 04:15.950
I haven't found anything.

04:16.480 --> 04:17.769
Mom,

04:18.000 --> 04:19.660
nothing has been decided yet.

04:19.680 --> 04:20.970
Just stop worrying about it.

04:20.970 --> 04:23.280
I know what I'm doing
with my relationships.

04:23.280 --> 04:24.280
Also,

04:24.400 --> 04:25.530
for Ms. Fang's sake,

04:25.640 --> 04:27.750
I think you'd better
go to the property management

04:27.750 --> 04:29.160
and explain the situation.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.670
If they're really going to fine her,

04:30.670 --> 04:31.600
I'll pay for it.

04:32.480 --> 04:33.280
Son,

04:33.430 --> 04:35.040
w-will my behavior today

04:35.040 --> 04:37.430
a-affect your job in any way?

04:37.430 --> 04:38.640
No, it won't.

04:38.659 --> 04:39.600
Don't worry.

04:40.350 --> 04:41.680
-I've got a call.
-What?

04:43.350 --> 04:44.159
Hello?

04:45.230 --> 04:46.159
Okay, Chief.

04:46.180 --> 04:47.240
I'll be right down.

04:47.640 --> 04:48.420
I've got to go, Mom.

04:48.420 --> 04:49.890
Okay, hurry and go.

04:49.920 --> 04:51.780
I... I'm leaving right away, too.

04:55.350 --> 04:56.230
Go home early.

04:56.230 --> 04:57.130
I know.

05:09.450 --> 05:10.300
Today's inspection is

05:10.300 --> 05:11.310
completely finished.

05:11.310 --> 05:13.040
Overall, I am quite satisfied.

05:13.040 --> 05:13.720
However...

05:16.870 --> 05:17.520
Mom.

05:17.520 --> 05:18.600
Jun.

05:19.920 --> 05:22.190
I got home early.

05:22.430 --> 05:24.130
Why aren't you back yet?

05:25.080 --> 05:27.410
I just finished the fire inspection here.

05:27.660 --> 05:29.320
I just got out of the building.

05:31.040 --> 05:32.570
Mom, I'll talk to you later.

05:33.240 --> 05:34.190
Jun.

05:34.230 --> 05:36.220
Is your stomach upset again?

05:37.159 --> 05:38.690
The meeting isn't over yet.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.480
Why did he hang up?

05:43.720 --> 05:44.890
Did you hear what I just said?

05:44.890 --> 05:45.610
Yes, I heard you.

05:45.610 --> 05:47.540
You're writing our team's report.

05:48.060 --> 05:48.920
You need to state clearly

05:48.920 --> 05:50.600
which units have what problems

05:50.600 --> 05:51.760
and by when the rectification
will be completed.

05:51.760 --> 05:53.159
-Where did she go?
-Is there any problem?

05:53.159 --> 05:54.210
She was gone in the blink of an eye.

05:54.210 --> 05:54.800
Okay.

05:55.730 --> 05:57.170
Let's run slowly first.

05:57.200 --> 05:58.460
Watch your breathing.

06:00.480 --> 06:01.710
Lift your posture.

06:03.230 --> 06:04.110
That's right.

06:10.330 --> 06:11.390
Okay, good.

06:15.070 --> 06:16.160
Psycho.

06:16.900 --> 06:18.900
I wasn't talking about you. Not you.

06:18.960 --> 06:19.840
Run slowly.

06:21.400 --> 06:22.400
Keep your body upright.

06:22.400 --> 06:23.460
Breathe steadily.

06:26.430 --> 06:27.720
Now, speed up.

06:43.080 --> 06:44.210
Miss, what's wrong?

06:49.590 --> 06:51.140
What is this thing?

06:51.159 --> 06:52.560
Are you done stalking me?

07:03.390 --> 07:04.480
I'm not stalking you.

07:04.480 --> 07:06.540
I just happen to be running here, too.

07:06.680 --> 07:07.940
This is a coincidence.

07:10.430 --> 07:10.990
Bye.

07:15.600 --> 07:17.200
Let's go. We'll run this way.

07:20.640 --> 07:21.260
Keep up.

07:21.550 --> 07:22.310
In 3 days,

07:21.690 --> 07:23.150
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

07:22.310 --> 07:23.640
I will polish up the entire plan

07:23.640 --> 07:24.600
and submit it to Chairman Liao.

07:23.720 --> 07:28.420
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

07:24.600 --> 07:26.430
Then you just need to re-verify

07:26.430 --> 07:28.030
what I've checked every day.

07:28.040 --> 07:29.040
No problem, Boss.

07:29.550 --> 07:30.190
Boss,

07:31.040 --> 07:32.350
I really can't imagine

07:32.350 --> 07:33.990
who could sort out this mess

07:34.040 --> 07:37.220
for Shan Li Fang Hotel
in such a short time...

07:40.040 --> 07:41.520
Boss, let's go.

07:43.450 --> 07:45.870
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

07:43.550 --> 07:43.790
Come on.

07:43.790 --> 07:44.130
I feel...

07:44.130 --> 07:46.450
I keep feeling like
I've left something behind.

07:46.450 --> 07:48.290
I'm not feeling at ease somehow.

07:49.159 --> 07:51.020
-It's okay.
-Hold on. Wait for me.

07:51.040 --> 07:51.820
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

07:53.010 --> 07:53.890
Thanks.

08:00.430 --> 08:01.080
Qian Fei.

08:01.100 --> 08:02.520
Did you figure out
the question you asked me

08:02.520 --> 08:03.190
this afternoon?

08:03.190 --> 08:04.040
Yes, I've figured it out

08:04.040 --> 08:04.590
thanks to you.

08:04.590 --> 08:05.290
Thank you.

08:05.310 --> 08:06.510
It's nothing.

08:06.540 --> 08:09.050
Everyone goes through the stage
where you are now.

08:09.050 --> 08:10.460
Don't lump everyone together.

08:10.460 --> 08:11.300
I didn't.

08:11.890 --> 08:14.160
I'm actually quite curious.

08:14.230 --> 08:16.430
I've been working
at He Jing Securities for 3 years,

08:16.430 --> 08:19.550
and now I'm working
with you guys at Zhizhong Investment.

08:19.550 --> 08:20.710
People in investment banking are

08:20.710 --> 08:22.970
usually quite tense

08:22.990 --> 08:24.120
and also speak fast.

08:24.310 --> 08:25.430
How do you manage

08:25.470 --> 08:26.870
to look so relaxed?

08:26.900 --> 08:29.150
I'm older than all the others.

08:29.190 --> 08:32.720
If I don't take it easy,
I'd be working myself to death for money.

08:33.990 --> 08:36.549
This job mainly runs on health, you know?

08:43.640 --> 08:45.870
I plan to work for a few more years

08:46.400 --> 08:47.650
and then change careers.

08:47.650 --> 08:48.580
What will you do?

08:48.880 --> 08:50.030
I haven't decided yet.

08:50.030 --> 08:51.550
Maybe I'll go back to my hometown.

08:51.550 --> 08:53.030
First, I'll find a wife,

08:53.050 --> 08:55.310
and then open a private restaurant

08:55.550 --> 08:56.810
or maybe a bar with her.

08:56.910 --> 08:59.840
Our job is a young man's game.

08:57.310 --> 09:00.010
[Do you want a free ride home?]

09:00.230 --> 09:01.520
You see, I'm almost 40.

09:01.550 --> 09:03.160
It's time to step down

09:03.050 --> 09:04.040
[Do you want a free ride home?]

09:03.280 --> 09:05.160
and live a simple, happy life.

09:05.950 --> 09:07.490
That sounds great.

09:07.420 --> 09:08.730
[Do you want a free ride home?]

09:08.160 --> 09:09.190
In this case,

09:08.750 --> 09:09.310
[No.]

09:09.190 --> 09:11.120
you can be the boss of your own turf.

09:11.550 --> 09:12.830
You must do it.

09:12.630 --> 09:13.180
[No.]

09:13.040 --> 09:13.930
Good luck to me.

09:13.430 --> 09:13.810
[Do you want a free ride home?]

09:13.830 --> 09:14.200
[No.]

09:14.000 --> 09:14.930
Good luck to you.

09:19.510 --> 09:20.030
Here we are.

09:19.620 --> 09:20.640
[You're not going home to cook?]

09:23.000 --> 09:24.120
Bye, Director Li.

09:24.590 --> 09:26.310
Bye, Boss.

09:27.130 --> 09:27.780
Qian Fei.

10:22.790 --> 10:23.140
[Recommendation]

10:23.160 --> 10:23.610
[Notice: The streamer you follow,]

10:23.630 --> 10:24.010
[Bad Name Took Me Forever, is live now.]

10:33.000 --> 10:33.660
[Click to join the livestream.]

10:33.790 --> 10:34.980
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

10:41.410 --> 10:43.810
Get ready for the team fight
in the top lane.

10:45.280 --> 10:46.070
Wait, wait,

10:46.070 --> 10:47.330
wait until I get there.

10:49.750 --> 10:51.750
Control them. My ultimate is ready.

10:55.750 --> 10:57.810
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

11:16.880 --> 11:17.720
[Fortune Dumpling Restaurant]

11:17.740 --> 11:18.650
[Huilisong Supermarket]

11:18.680 --> 11:19.770
[Wallace Burger&Chicken]

11:27.750 --> 11:28.440
[Defeated]

11:34.180 --> 11:34.610
[Joined the livestream.] [Invincible.]

11:34.630 --> 11:35.970
[Open the door and have dinner first.]

11:36.360 --> 11:37.160
What the heck?

12:05.920 --> 12:06.710
Prime Minister,

12:06.710 --> 12:08.640
no more tipping in the live stream.

12:08.760 --> 12:09.710
If you send any more gifts,

12:09.710 --> 12:10.880
I'll ban you.

12:13.720 --> 12:15.650
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

12:23.150 --> 12:23.590
[Open the door and have dinner first.]

12:23.610 --> 12:24.390
[Okay.]

12:40.510 --> 12:42.420
Hello, Bad Name.

12:43.240 --> 12:44.240
Stop right there.

12:54.950 --> 12:57.240
How much longer
are you going to stalk me, you pervert?

12:57.240 --> 12:58.490
Let me explain.

12:58.710 --> 13:00.280
I really didn't stalk you.

13:00.930 --> 13:03.950
I merely showed up
in the same public places

13:04.000 --> 13:04.950
as you

13:05.040 --> 13:07.440
and just casually observed
your daily life.

13:07.440 --> 13:08.560
You've really reshaped

13:08.560 --> 13:10.890
my understanding of the word "stalking."

13:12.550 --> 13:15.000
You were the one who waited for me
outside my company, right?

13:15.000 --> 13:15.360
Yes.

13:15.550 --> 13:18.400
And now you've even had
the takeout delivered right to my home.

13:18.400 --> 13:19.610
Seeing your behaviors,

13:19.610 --> 13:21.200
a timid person would
either call the police

13:21.200 --> 13:22.400
or be scared to death.

13:23.120 --> 13:24.000
Did I scare you?

13:24.550 --> 13:25.350
Sorry, sorry.

13:25.440 --> 13:26.590
I'll be more careful next time

13:26.590 --> 13:27.950
and try not to let you find out.

13:27.950 --> 13:29.120
You want a next time?

13:29.920 --> 13:30.950
I mean,

13:31.310 --> 13:34.330
next time, I want to see you aboveboard,

13:34.760 --> 13:36.560
and then do these things for you.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.320
Fine, I'll call the police right now.

13:39.320 --> 13:41.520
I've recorded you following me anyway.

13:41.520 --> 13:42.170
No, please don't!

13:42.170 --> 13:42.880
No, no.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.080
How dare you touch me?

13:44.520 --> 13:45.320
Listen,

13:45.350 --> 13:47.210
even fan behavior has its limits.

13:47.280 --> 13:49.120
Do you know why I don't
show my face during livestreams?

13:49.120 --> 13:51.650
It is to guard against frenetic fans
like you.

13:52.000 --> 13:53.290
I'm not a frenetic fan.

13:53.310 --> 13:54.760
I swear I'm a true fan, you know?

13:54.760 --> 13:56.280
You're truly sick.

14:01.160 --> 14:01.920
Actually,

14:02.120 --> 14:04.190
I just want to know more about you.

14:09.710 --> 14:10.280
Fine.

14:11.120 --> 14:11.920
Today,

14:11.920 --> 14:13.310
considering that you're the friend

14:13.310 --> 14:14.510
of Qian Fei's tenant,

14:14.880 --> 14:15.880
I'll let it slide.

14:16.880 --> 14:18.230
But if you do this again,

14:18.470 --> 14:20.400
I will definitely call the police.

14:20.430 --> 14:21.590
Do you understand?

14:33.040 --> 14:35.240
How can I not show up within your sight

14:35.670 --> 14:37.200
but still stay in your mind?

14:58.670 --> 15:00.670
The cooking in this restaurant is
getting worse.

15:00.670 --> 15:01.320
Is it?

15:04.240 --> 15:05.030
How can

15:05.150 --> 15:07.060
there be such a great girl?

15:07.310 --> 15:08.880
She looks pretty, has a nice voice,

15:08.880 --> 15:10.150
plays games well,

15:10.430 --> 15:11.630
has personality and a bit of attitude,

15:11.630 --> 15:12.380
is independent,

15:12.380 --> 15:14.270
and on top of all that, can do everything.

15:14.270 --> 15:15.720
She is so charming.

15:16.950 --> 15:19.120
I think you're into her hands.

15:19.470 --> 15:20.620
Of course not.

15:20.670 --> 15:22.310
I like her as a person.

15:22.400 --> 15:24.760
I like everything about her.

15:24.830 --> 15:26.430
If you like her,
just go pursue her directly.

15:26.430 --> 15:27.310
Telling me about it

15:27.310 --> 15:28.910
won't help you get anywhere.

15:31.550 --> 15:32.870
But she said

15:32.920 --> 15:33.780
if she sees me again,

15:33.780 --> 15:35.180
she will call the police.

15:36.310 --> 15:37.240
Call the police?

15:37.920 --> 15:39.520
Look at your comprehension.

15:39.710 --> 15:41.640
She said she didn't want to see you,

15:41.920 --> 15:43.040
so you just gave up?

15:43.240 --> 15:44.640
Use your brain, will you?

15:45.520 --> 15:47.360
Since she doesn't like me
pursuing her so aggressively,

15:47.360 --> 15:48.710
shouldn't I respect her?

15:48.710 --> 15:50.790
"The Art of War" is about strategy.

15:50.830 --> 15:53.190
"The Thirty-Six Stratagems" is
about tactics.

15:53.190 --> 15:54.830
Tactics serve strategy,

15:54.990 --> 15:56.650
and strategy guides tactics.

15:56.670 --> 15:58.000
Respect her strategically

15:58.000 --> 15:59.470
to ease her vigilance.

15:59.490 --> 16:00.790
Approach her tactically

16:00.790 --> 16:02.320
to look for an opportunity.

16:02.710 --> 16:03.910
Applaud if you got it.

16:06.920 --> 16:07.950
I didn't get it.

16:10.760 --> 16:12.970
Simply put,

16:13.430 --> 16:14.520
if you want to pursue her,

16:14.520 --> 16:16.050
if you want to pursue a girl,

16:16.310 --> 16:17.640
you need to have thick enough skin.

16:17.640 --> 16:18.410
Got it?

16:18.950 --> 16:19.610
Got it.

16:20.470 --> 16:22.730
Then, did you manage to win Qian Fei over?

16:25.380 --> 16:26.520
What an overreaction!

16:26.520 --> 16:27.490
I was just asking about

16:27.490 --> 16:28.980
the progress
between you and your landlady.

16:28.980 --> 16:30.780
Why did you overreact like that?

16:30.920 --> 16:33.650
When did I ever say I wanted to pursue
my landlady?

16:34.530 --> 16:35.550
Such a sudden question

16:35.550 --> 16:37.400
would of course scare me to spit my drink.

16:37.400 --> 16:38.360
You like her,

16:38.920 --> 16:40.190
but you don't pursue her.

16:40.190 --> 16:43.060
You just want to be a brilliant tenant.

16:45.310 --> 16:46.910
It's not that I don't want to.

16:49.020 --> 16:51.350
I just don't
want to think about it for now.

16:52.030 --> 16:53.990
Is it that you don't
want to think about it,

16:53.990 --> 16:56.990
or that you're afraid you won't get her
even if you try?

16:57.030 --> 16:58.350
It looks like

16:58.400 --> 17:01.060
you've already failed
before you even started.

17:01.800 --> 17:02.560
Well,

17:03.270 --> 17:05.069
I hadn't even said anything yet,

17:05.069 --> 17:06.599
and she already swore to God

17:06.670 --> 17:08.430
that she would never like me in her life,

17:08.430 --> 17:09.710
and if she ever fell for me one day,

17:09.710 --> 17:11.920
she'd be struck by lightning,
lose her job, and go bankrupt.

17:11.920 --> 17:13.200
Do you think I still dare to pursue her?

17:13.200 --> 17:14.599
Even if I dare to, well...

17:15.960 --> 17:16.880
can she bear it?

17:16.910 --> 17:17.440
She can't.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.560
She definitely can't bear it.

17:18.560 --> 17:21.079
That would be like
tempting God to commit a crime.

17:21.079 --> 17:21.710
Exactly.

17:24.079 --> 17:25.140
Looking at you,

17:25.270 --> 17:27.329
I suddenly feel that I'm quite lucky.

17:28.030 --> 17:29.880
At least I can still pursue her
if I want to.

17:29.880 --> 17:32.320
Even if I fail, there won't be a disaster.

17:34.650 --> 17:35.650
Let's drink, bro.

17:36.840 --> 17:38.420
Wish you and your landlady

17:38.960 --> 17:41.330
can stay together for as long as possible.

17:41.880 --> 17:43.030
What do you mean?

17:43.810 --> 17:44.970
Don't jinx it.

17:45.670 --> 17:46.400
Let's eat up.

17:47.120 --> 17:47.580
Come on.

18:10.230 --> 18:11.280
[No Unnecessary Disturbance]

18:15.510 --> 18:17.450
What tricks is she playing again?

18:22.330 --> 18:25.970
[No Unnecessary Disturbance]

18:26.060 --> 18:30.010
[Make the city more civilized;
make life better.]

18:33.980 --> 18:35.300
Why are you still up?

18:38.050 --> 18:39.390
Be honest with me.

18:40.710 --> 18:41.990
Are you making

18:42.360 --> 18:43.920
any progress with that girl?

18:43.920 --> 18:46.110
You've been coming home so late every day.

18:46.110 --> 18:47.830
What are you talking about?

18:47.920 --> 18:49.960
I just had dinner with Yifei.

18:50.120 --> 18:52.780
And I was working overtime the other day.

18:53.640 --> 18:55.170
What kind of overtime work?

18:55.270 --> 18:57.370
The kind that paid double?

18:57.880 --> 19:00.230
You're never this happy
when working overtime.

19:00.230 --> 19:01.230
Tell us the truth.

19:03.810 --> 19:04.630
Son, let me tell you.

19:04.630 --> 19:07.330
On my way back
from the Financial Center today,

19:07.360 --> 19:08.620
I was pondering over it

19:08.670 --> 19:10.300
and thought you were
hiding something from me.

19:10.300 --> 19:11.740
You kept pushing me,

19:11.840 --> 19:13.560
telling me to hurry back.

19:13.600 --> 19:16.160
-You must be hiding something from me!
-Yeah, you were up to something.

19:16.160 --> 19:17.120
Nope!

19:17.150 --> 19:19.130
My colleagues called me over
for a fire inspection.

19:19.130 --> 19:20.600
I-I was working.

19:20.970 --> 19:22.940
Alright, alright, let's drop it.

19:23.270 --> 19:24.630
Jun, let me ask you.

19:24.930 --> 19:27.480
How are things going
between you and that girl?

19:27.480 --> 19:29.000
What is she like?

19:29.030 --> 19:30.490
How is her family background?

19:30.490 --> 19:31.770
How is her character?

19:31.800 --> 19:33.500
Your mom and I are very worried.

19:33.500 --> 19:35.770
If this keeps going further,

19:35.800 --> 19:38.190
your mom and I
have to take responsibility.

19:38.190 --> 19:39.140
Dad,

19:39.270 --> 19:41.330
you're getting way ahead of yourselves.

19:41.330 --> 19:43.660
I've just been
a bit busy with work lately.

19:43.790 --> 19:45.900
I'm so busy that I've almost forgotten

19:45.900 --> 19:47.300
what the girl looks like.

19:47.470 --> 19:48.740
You're busy, huh?

19:49.360 --> 19:50.160
Okay, fine.

19:50.160 --> 19:51.520
I'll introduce you

19:51.820 --> 19:53.550
to our leader's daughter.

19:53.760 --> 19:54.370
Mom,

19:55.060 --> 19:56.940
my director just told me today

19:57.280 --> 19:58.890
that I've been working hard

19:58.910 --> 20:00.180
and might get

20:00.530 --> 20:01.940
a promotion by the end of the year!

20:01.940 --> 20:03.160
Do not set me up on blind dates lately,

20:03.160 --> 20:04.690
or they will affect my work.

20:04.790 --> 20:05.640
A promotion?

20:05.670 --> 20:06.810
You're getting a promotion?

20:06.810 --> 20:07.190
For real?

20:07.190 --> 20:09.720
T-Then you'll become
a deputy section chief!

20:11.080 --> 20:11.770
Son.

20:11.800 --> 20:13.910
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

20:13.940 --> 20:16.230
You made me guess all day

20:16.360 --> 20:18.110
and really exhausted me.

20:18.160 --> 20:19.270
Your attitude when you're back today

20:19.270 --> 20:21.270
matches your promotion quite well.

20:23.400 --> 20:24.320
Son.

20:25.030 --> 20:25.940
G-Go get some rest.

20:25.940 --> 20:27.160
-You may go to sleep.
-Yeah.

20:27.160 --> 20:29.020
W-Well, get some rest early.

20:29.190 --> 20:31.640
From now on, don't worry

20:31.640 --> 20:33.710
-about anything in life.
-Yes, we'll cover everything for you.

20:33.710 --> 20:34.470
Don't worry about it.

20:34.470 --> 20:36.640
-Y-You'll have nothing to worry about.
-Yeah.

20:36.640 --> 20:38.300
-Go to sleep.
-Go hit the sack.

20:38.710 --> 20:39.840
Get some rest early.

20:42.260 --> 20:43.330
Our son is getting promoted.

20:43.330 --> 20:43.810
Yeah.

20:43.840 --> 20:45.130
If he gets promoted again,

20:45.130 --> 20:46.910
then he will be a role model

20:46.950 --> 20:49.160
for the young people living in this alley.

20:49.160 --> 20:49.990
Role model.

20:50.750 --> 20:52.160
I will be so successful.

20:53.410 --> 20:54.130
Honey,

20:54.160 --> 20:55.240
I'll go to the mall tomorrow

20:55.240 --> 20:56.750
and buy you some nice clothes.

20:56.750 --> 20:58.610
You'll look great when you go out.

21:00.430 --> 21:01.530
What do I need them for?

21:01.530 --> 21:02.670
Won't that be a waste of money?

21:02.670 --> 21:04.000
Why are you so stubborn?

21:04.000 --> 21:05.740
What time is it now?

21:05.800 --> 21:07.060
Let's go to sleep, too.

21:11.750 --> 21:13.000
You go to sleep first.

21:13.360 --> 21:14.820
I can't fall asleep at all.

21:15.510 --> 21:17.910
It feels like
I drank a cup of strong coffee.

21:39.530 --> 21:40.200
Qian Fei!

21:41.190 --> 21:42.590
Aren't you going to work?

21:43.120 --> 21:44.210
Oh, no. Oh, no.

21:44.320 --> 21:45.760
I'm going to be late.

22:10.790 --> 22:11.760
Wait for me!

22:22.360 --> 22:24.600
What were you doing
hiding in your room last night?

22:24.600 --> 22:25.720
Studying.

22:26.160 --> 22:28.180
Who said that work is the only thing
in the world

22:28.180 --> 22:30.430
that won't let your great efforts
go to waste?

22:30.430 --> 22:31.900
It's true that work won't fail you,

22:31.900 --> 22:33.430
but you have to take it easy.

22:33.790 --> 22:35.480
Don't "exhaust the work."

22:35.840 --> 22:37.040
You should drive now.

23:21.360 --> 23:23.200
Li Yifei, oh, Li Yifei.

23:24.190 --> 23:26.070
You call yourself a love expert.

23:26.600 --> 23:28.900
How did you fall for a weirdo?

24:00.120 --> 24:01.860
Annual amortization

24:03.190 --> 24:06.360
equals the original cost
divided by the useful life.

24:09.420 --> 24:10.020
Question.

24:10.640 --> 24:12.540
According to the National Tax Law,

24:12.540 --> 24:14.410
when real estate is invested as equity,

24:14.410 --> 24:16.850
and the investor
participates in profit distribution

24:16.850 --> 24:18.960
and shares investment risks,

24:19.520 --> 24:20.640
is it subject to business tax?

24:20.640 --> 24:22.640
It is not subject to business tax...

24:26.090 --> 24:27.710
Don't get too obsessed.

24:28.250 --> 24:29.170
Where are we?

24:29.600 --> 24:30.680
We've arrived.

24:31.080 --> 24:32.280
We are at Shan Li Fang?

24:32.370 --> 24:33.380
Of course.

24:34.040 --> 24:35.440
Why didn't you wake me up?

24:36.010 --> 24:37.720
Seeing you sleep so soundly,

24:37.750 --> 24:38.810
I couldn't bear to.

24:39.800 --> 24:41.560
I am so kind-hearted.

24:42.880 --> 24:44.550
Aren't you afraid
our colleagues will see it?

24:44.550 --> 24:47.040
There aren't
any colleagues around right now.

24:47.040 --> 24:48.770
Alright, get out of the car now.

24:50.990 --> 24:51.780
Thanks.

25:29.210 --> 25:32.800
[Office Area]

25:43.030 --> 25:43.890
Director Wang.

25:44.560 --> 25:46.490
Are you looking for Director Fang?

25:48.180 --> 25:51.310
This is signed and needs to be
passed on to Director Fang.

25:51.400 --> 25:52.200
Leave it to me.

25:52.640 --> 25:54.490
If you need me to pass anything on
in the future,

25:54.490 --> 25:55.420
just let me know.

25:55.470 --> 25:56.800
After all, it's my duty.

25:56.940 --> 25:59.000
You don't have to come here in person.

26:00.220 --> 26:00.790
Okay.

26:01.340 --> 26:02.270
Thank you, then.

26:02.840 --> 26:03.500
No worries.

26:12.470 --> 26:13.450
Not bad.

26:14.840 --> 26:15.770
He was blushing.

26:16.510 --> 26:17.310
No way.

26:17.510 --> 26:18.910
He was probably just hot.

26:19.080 --> 26:20.790
Good, you've made progress.

26:21.190 --> 26:22.650
Let me give you a thumbs up.

26:27.530 --> 26:28.750
[Come to the riverside
where we met last time.]

26:30.020 --> 26:30.840
Director Fang wants to see me.

26:30.840 --> 26:31.900
I'll get going now.

26:35.920 --> 26:36.690
Zhao.

26:46.540 --> 26:47.450
Director Fang.

26:50.510 --> 26:51.910
How have you been lately?

26:53.550 --> 26:54.660
Not bad.

26:57.070 --> 26:58.670
Probably not so good, right?

27:00.220 --> 27:02.080
I've been giving you the cold shoulder.

27:02.080 --> 27:03.040
Actually,

27:03.950 --> 27:05.230
it is because you made a mistake,

27:05.230 --> 27:06.690
but I'm not punishing you.

27:07.860 --> 27:10.590
Instead, I'm waiting for you
to clean up the mess.

27:10.760 --> 27:13.920
Don't you always like
taking the initiative to do something?

27:13.920 --> 27:15.190
You wrote the research report,

27:15.190 --> 27:16.760
went to Chengdu for research,

27:16.760 --> 27:18.590
and dropped a bombshell at the meeting

27:18.590 --> 27:19.750
with no warning.

27:20.640 --> 27:21.830
So why didn't you take

27:21.830 --> 27:24.490
the initiative
and give me a surprise this time?

27:27.820 --> 27:29.420
I did all those things before

27:29.780 --> 27:31.780
in order to survive in Shanghai

27:31.880 --> 27:33.410
and maintain a bottom line.

27:33.970 --> 27:35.440
But what I need to do now

27:35.470 --> 27:36.670
is integrate into the team

27:36.670 --> 27:38.870
and solve problems with everyone else.

27:40.710 --> 27:41.970
You've made progress.

27:44.500 --> 27:46.720
You are indeed different from others.

27:49.010 --> 27:50.850
Thank you for the praise, Director.

27:50.850 --> 27:52.310
Did I actually praise you?

27:53.990 --> 27:55.290
Did I praise you

27:56.020 --> 27:57.790
for your sense of ethics in finance

27:57.790 --> 27:59.460
or your professional bottom line?

27:59.460 --> 28:00.720
Do you know that you are

28:00.790 --> 28:02.790
not only impulsive but also stupid?

28:03.990 --> 28:04.990
In the workplace,

28:04.990 --> 28:06.940
they just need a fearless

28:07.160 --> 28:08.870
and reckless fool like you as a shield,

28:08.870 --> 28:09.560
you know?

28:09.670 --> 28:11.080
That's why you can still stand here.

28:11.080 --> 28:11.640
Got it?

28:15.800 --> 28:17.670
You are adorably dumb.

28:21.510 --> 28:23.060
Zhizhong Investment

28:23.880 --> 28:25.980
has always wanted
to get rid of the potential risk

28:25.980 --> 28:28.270
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's
financial fraud.

28:28.270 --> 28:30.460
So Li Yifei just used you

28:30.840 --> 28:32.100
to expose everything.

28:33.120 --> 28:33.840
Of course,

28:34.330 --> 28:36.320
He Jing also wants to stay out of this.

28:36.320 --> 28:37.670
But our two companies,

28:37.670 --> 28:38.840
whether in terms of background

28:38.840 --> 28:40.470
or our relationships with Shan Li Fang,

28:40.470 --> 28:41.640
are completely different.

28:41.640 --> 28:43.710
So there are many things Li Yifei can do,

28:43.710 --> 28:44.650
but I can't.

28:45.640 --> 28:46.450
Before this,

28:46.510 --> 28:47.400
I told you

28:47.400 --> 28:48.120
not to disclose

28:48.120 --> 28:49.750
the financial issues
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

28:49.750 --> 28:50.690
to anyone else.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.140
I originally intended

28:52.230 --> 28:53.360
to mediate as much as possible,

28:53.360 --> 28:55.190
solve this problem

28:55.320 --> 28:56.430
in private,

28:56.670 --> 28:58.470
and then discuss it at a meeting.

28:58.640 --> 29:00.770
But you exposed everything directly.

29:01.080 --> 29:02.360
You stirred up

29:02.430 --> 29:05.760
the hornet's nest
of Shan Li Fang Group's vested interests.

29:05.920 --> 29:07.780
A lot of trouble will come with it.

29:09.190 --> 29:10.650
Tell me how to solve it now.

29:12.950 --> 29:14.430
Have you figured out a solution?

29:14.430 --> 29:15.490
How do we sort out

29:15.750 --> 29:18.030
those messy accounts,
and where do we even start?

29:18.030 --> 29:19.760
I hope you can give me an answer.

29:20.190 --> 29:20.780
I...

29:23.400 --> 29:24.530
Director Fang, I...

29:24.640 --> 29:25.840
What do you want to say?

29:25.840 --> 29:27.030
You caused such a big trouble,

29:27.030 --> 29:27.950
yet I still keep you here.

29:27.950 --> 29:28.920
Do you know why?

29:30.320 --> 29:33.630
Because you have abilities
that others don't.

29:34.560 --> 29:35.220
Therefore,

29:35.360 --> 29:37.690
as I said before, don't waste your talent.

29:37.920 --> 29:39.380
Don't let Wang Ruohai

29:39.840 --> 29:41.090
mess you up.

29:42.360 --> 29:45.080
Stay composed and believe in yourself.

29:46.710 --> 29:47.640
Director Fang.

29:49.320 --> 29:53.070
Can I... Can I ask you for a favor?

29:53.750 --> 29:54.430
What is it?

29:55.800 --> 29:56.650
Well,

29:57.030 --> 29:57.990
can I quit being

29:58.030 --> 29:59.960
Director Li's special assistant?

30:00.470 --> 30:01.120
Why?

30:04.430 --> 30:05.160
Because...

30:07.230 --> 30:09.030
Because I want to learn from you.

30:13.360 --> 30:15.820
You can learn from both of us
at the same time.

30:16.360 --> 30:18.490
I see Director Li treat you quite well.

30:19.470 --> 30:20.930
But I must remind you that,

30:21.270 --> 30:23.880
although you are
Li Yifei's special assistant,

30:23.880 --> 30:25.880
you are still an employee of He Jing.

30:31.330 --> 30:33.880
Deception and using others
to do the dirty work—

30:33.880 --> 30:36.810
Li Yifei should be very good
at playing these tricks.

30:48.560 --> 30:50.510
What's with that expression of yours?

30:50.510 --> 30:51.520
Is it that bad?

30:53.910 --> 30:55.040
Really?

30:55.600 --> 30:58.400
-Can you let me focus on analyzing it?
-Wait, you can just tell me...

30:58.400 --> 30:59.010
Be quiet for a moment.

30:59.010 --> 31:00.540
Let me analyze it properly.

31:01.010 --> 31:02.670
How did your friend do this for you?

31:02.670 --> 31:03.650
It's such an important document.

31:03.650 --> 31:05.710
You should definitely
hand it over in person.

31:05.710 --> 31:07.840
Don't tell me you don't even have
the guts to do that.

31:07.840 --> 31:08.560
Your research report

31:08.560 --> 31:10.710
will be a bombshell against Liao Jinshan,

31:10.710 --> 31:12.910
and it's a nuclear-level one, you know?

31:14.400 --> 31:15.430
Have I

31:16.320 --> 31:18.450
really been used by him the whole time?

31:19.430 --> 31:24.870
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

31:37.640 --> 31:38.470
Very good.

31:38.840 --> 31:39.800
You've made progress.

31:39.800 --> 31:41.600
We'll finish when the time's up.

31:43.360 --> 31:43.920
Okay.

31:43.950 --> 31:45.480
Hello, excuse me.

31:46.080 --> 31:46.600
Excuse me,

31:46.600 --> 31:48.310
are you Miss Dang Yu?

31:48.920 --> 31:49.470
Yes.

31:50.230 --> 31:51.430
Great. Just a moment.

31:51.470 --> 31:52.470
Did you order this?

31:52.470 --> 31:53.570
Nope.

31:54.160 --> 31:56.870
Here, these are flowers for you.

31:58.640 --> 31:59.310
Thank you.

31:59.430 --> 32:00.400
Please wait a moment.

32:00.400 --> 32:01.360
The client also asked me

32:01.360 --> 32:02.440
to read the card.

32:02.880 --> 32:03.600
Don't bother.

32:03.600 --> 32:04.640
-No way.
-Miss...

32:04.750 --> 32:06.280
-Let's hear him out.
-Yeah.

32:06.430 --> 32:07.980
This is my job.

32:08.080 --> 32:09.430
Hope you can understand.

32:09.430 --> 32:09.960
Okay.

32:12.160 --> 32:13.480
Miss Dang Yu,

32:13.800 --> 32:14.930
you are one

32:15.230 --> 32:16.450
of a kind in the world.

32:16.600 --> 32:19.780
And you are the only superstar
in my heart.

32:21.400 --> 32:21.950
Done?

32:22.120 --> 32:23.780
There's one more thing. Here.

32:30.670 --> 32:31.400
These postures were

32:31.400 --> 32:33.400
also what the client
requested me to show you.

32:33.400 --> 32:35.140
Okay, wish you have a nice day.

32:35.190 --> 32:36.920
If you are satisfied with my service,

32:36.920 --> 32:38.800
please remember to give me good feedback.

32:38.800 --> 32:41.260
I'm satisfied.
I'll give you good feedback.

32:41.470 --> 32:42.160
Thank you.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.170
Bye-bye.

32:49.800 --> 32:50.830
Funny, huh?

32:53.080 --> 32:55.080
It's okay. Just laugh if you want to.

32:57.780 --> 32:59.440
You really dare to laugh, huh?

33:00.560 --> 33:02.890
Add weights and run for another half hour.

33:04.710 --> 33:05.360
Hello.

33:05.430 --> 33:07.880
Excuse me.
Are you Bad Name Took Me Forever?

33:08.510 --> 33:09.330
Yes.

33:10.030 --> 33:11.830
But how did you know that it's me?

33:12.880 --> 33:13.610
[The recipient of the takeout
is a cool bartender girl.]

33:15.390 --> 33:16.820
[The recipient of the takeout
is a cool bartender girl.]

33:18.800 --> 33:19.510
Thank you.

33:31.030 --> 33:31.830
President Li.

33:34.120 --> 33:35.070
Director Li,

33:35.230 --> 33:36.830
are you looking for Qian Fei?

33:37.270 --> 33:37.920
I...

33:38.270 --> 33:40.000
She's already left for the day.

33:40.030 --> 33:41.560
I'm just here to grab something.

33:41.560 --> 33:42.320
See you tomorrow.

33:42.320 --> 33:42.880
See you.

33:50.670 --> 33:52.590
She's clocked out so quickly.

33:59.790 --> 34:01.450
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

35:24.620 --> 35:25.010
[Speed Express: Dear user,]

35:25.030 --> 35:25.460
[your order to Shanghai has been delivered
and signed for. The recipient is]

35:25.480 --> 35:26.010
["Bro Bad Name." Thank you for choosing
our service. Have a great day.]

35:28.280 --> 35:29.070
"Bro"?

35:30.200 --> 35:30.990
Let me see.

35:36.510 --> 35:37.510
I feel a bit dizzy.

35:39.530 --> 35:40.320
My blood pressure...

35:40.320 --> 35:41.050
Dear.

35:41.510 --> 35:44.630
-What are you doing with my phone?
-My blood pressure...

35:44.630 --> 35:46.070
Go hang out with your bro.

35:46.550 --> 35:47.350
Come on, dear.

35:47.680 --> 35:50.810
-What's wrong with my mom?
-My blood pressure is rising.

35:52.510 --> 35:53.880
You guys got me wrong.

35:53.950 --> 35:55.080
Dad! Mom!

35:56.150 --> 35:57.590
You misunderstood!

36:09.470 --> 36:11.010
Landlady, I'm back.

36:16.070 --> 36:16.870
Landlady?

36:42.840 --> 36:45.500
Do you really have
that many social activities?

36:46.590 --> 36:47.590
Didn't you say

36:47.590 --> 36:50.190
you'd focus on learning from me,
your teacher?

36:50.920 --> 36:52.580
Your teacher is already home.

36:52.880 --> 36:54.160
But where are you?

36:58.360 --> 37:00.260
It's so boring being home alone.

37:02.630 --> 37:10.700
[Conference Room]

37:21.360 --> 37:23.920
Deception and using others
to do the dirty work—

37:23.920 --> 37:26.850
Li Yifei should be very good
at playing these tricks.

37:45.030 --> 37:45.800
Qian Fei,

37:46.410 --> 37:48.500
you can even let go of Wang Ruohai.

37:48.590 --> 37:50.390
Why can't you let go of this?

38:06.320 --> 38:07.440
He was right.

38:07.630 --> 38:09.490
Only work will never let you down.

38:10.030 --> 38:12.070
There are no saviors in this world.

38:12.240 --> 38:14.500
The only one who can save you is yourself.

39:34.130 --> 39:36.990
[Landlady, why aren't you back yet?]

39:48.910 --> 39:49.880
[I'm worried about my safety
with the door unlocked.]

39:49.910 --> 39:51.010
[Where are you?]

39:51.040 --> 39:52.390
[Hello, landlady?
Tell me if you're still alive.]

39:52.410 --> 39:54.200
[Landlady, were you kidnapped by someone?]

39:57.020 --> 39:57.520
[Voice call]

39:57.520 --> 39:58.990
[Qian Fei]

40:17.700 --> 40:21.390
[Presentation of Asset Organization Plan]

40:38.420 --> 40:38.830
[I'm worried about my safety
with the door unlocked.]

40:38.850 --> 40:39.300
[Where are you?]

40:39.320 --> 40:39.720
[Hello, landlady?
Tell me if you're still alive.]

40:39.740 --> 40:40.260
[Landlady, were you kidnapped by someone?]

40:51.330 --> 40:53.530
[Conference Room]

41:29.230 --> 41:30.520
[Presentation of Asset Organization Plan]

41:49.190 --> 41:50.950
[Director, I made a plan to quickly solve]

41:50.980 --> 41:52.660
[the asset organization
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.]

41:52.790 --> 41:56.840
[Presentation of Asset Organization Plan]

42:00.210 --> 42:00.780
[Director, I made a plan to quickly solve]

42:00.810 --> 42:01.390
[the asset organization
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.]

42:01.420 --> 42:02.560
[It can improve efficiency by two-thirds
and speed up completion.]

42:02.590 --> 42:03.370
[I hope I can discuss it with everyone
in the morning.]

42:07.540 --> 42:08.780
[Presentation of Asset Organization Plan]

