42:52.130 --> 42:53.670
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.200 --> 42:54.860
Tell me.

42:55.240 --> 42:57.370
Your attitude changed dramatically.

42:58.340 --> 42:58.860
